  "lapsed_date": "28/02/2028",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development fails to comply with the limitations of permitted development under Q.1(a) specified under Class Q of Part 3, of Schedule 2, of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended) as insufficient evidence has been submitted to demonstrate that, on the balance of probability, the existing building is on an established agricultural unit and is, or previously, in use as an agricultural building.",
    "The proposed development fails to comply with the  limitations of permitted development under Q.1(j)(i) specified under Class Q of Part 3, of Schedule 2, of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended) as the proposed development involves the extensive refurbishment of the existing building, well beyond the scope of conversion considered appropriate under Class Q, to be capable of functioning as a dwellinghouse.",
    "The proposed development fails to comply with the  limitations of permitted development under Q.1(o) specified under Class Q of Part 3, of Schedule 2, of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended) as proposed Bedroom 2 and 3 would be undersized and would not comply with the nationally described space standards.",
    "The proposed development fails to comply with condition Q.2(1)(a) specified under Class Q of Part 3, of Schedule 2, of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended) as insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate the proposed site access arrangement would not adversely impact the local road network in terms of function and safety."
  ],
